                               Abbreviations

:iabbrev teh the         when you type "teh " it becomes "the "
:iabbrev recieve receive
:iabbrev @@ user@example.com

Abbreviations expand automatically when you type a space, punctuation, or
press enter after the trigger word in insert mode.

:iabbrev       (with no arguments) lists all current abbreviations
