                              Quick Reference

Normal mode:
  hjkl          move cursor
  w b e         word forward, backward, end
  W B E         WORD forward, backward, end (whitespace-delimited)
  iw aw iW aW   word / WORD text objects (with operators or Visual mode)
  i( a( i[ a[ i{ a{ i< a< i" a"   bracket and quote objects (also ib ab iB aB i' i`)
  0 $ ^         line start, end, first non-blank
  G gg          go to end/start of file
  x X           delete char forward/backward
  dd D          delete line / to end
  cc C          change line / to end
  yy            yank line
  p P           paste after/before
  u ^r          undo / redo
  U             undo line
  .             repeat last change
  /  ?          search forward / backward
  * # g* g#     search for word under cursor
  n N           next / previous match
  %             bracket match
  f F t T       find char on line
  ; ,           repeat / reverse find
  v V           visual mode (char / line)
  >> <<         indent / dedent
  ~             toggle case
  J             join lines
  ZZ ZQ         save+quit / quit
  "x            use register x
  ma 'a `a      set mark / jump to mark line / exact
  qa @a         record macro / play macro
  ^o ^i         jump back / forward
  ^g            file info
  ^f ^b ^d ^u   scroll full/half page
